{
  "_": "KC-0244: what scripts/site-billeder.mjs captures from the test world, one entry per image on the front page. English files keep their names, Danish ones end in .da.webp. `moment` is a moment of the test world (src/testtilstand/indhold/fakta.ts, start.ts), `route` the room, `crop` what is cut out at 375 px wide: `element` (one box) or `from` + `to` (from the top of one box to the bottom of the other, `fullWidth` keeps the page's side margins).  A box is a CSS `selector` (the first match). No `crop` = the whole viewport.",
